IT-Tools 2024.10.22-7ca5933 — reference distribution
====================================================

What is distributed here
------------------------
it-tools-2024.10.22-7ca5933.zip is the unmodified release archive of IT-Tools v2024.10.22-7ca5933
(https://github.com/CorentinTh/it-tools/releases/download/v2024.10.22-7ca5933/it-tools-2024.10.22-7ca5933.zip,
sha256 eef276d675db6053bdc65cd8482a566785561c70eed5035a0e05b0e627b0989d). It holds the built static site (dist/).
server.py and start.sh are task-authored: they serve the files of dist/ unchanged from the archive; no product file
is modified.

